---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Never miss a PRAZ tender again"
  description="TenderPulse watches Zimbabwe's PRAZ e-GP portal for you and alerts you the moment a tender matches your business."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Built for Zimbabwe</span>
      <h1>Never miss a government tender in Zimbabwe again.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        TenderPulse watches PRAZ's e-Government Procurement portal (egp.praz.org.zw) around the
        clock and tells you the moment a tender matches what your business actually does —
        no more refreshing a government website by hand.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/signup">Get free alerts</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--subtle">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="eyebrow">The problem</span>
          <h3>Tenders are easy to miss</h3>
          <p>
            PRAZ publishes new tenders continuously across every sector and region in Zimbabwe.
            Checking manually means you either watch constantly or find out too late.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="eyebrow">The solution</span>
          <h3>We watch PRAZ for you</h3>
          <p>
            TenderPulse fetches PRAZ e-GP tenders on a shared schedule and matches them against
            the sectors, value range, region and keywords you tell us matter to your business.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="eyebrow">The result</span>
          <h3>You get notified, not buried</h3>
          <p>
            Free plans get a daily digest of matches. Paid plans get notified as soon as a match
            is found in each aggregation run — either way, always a link back to the official
            PRAZ listing, never a copy.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <h2>Set up your first alert in a couple of minutes</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
        Tell us your email, choose a plan, and start getting matched PRAZ tenders for Zimbabwe —
        free to start, no commitment required.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup">Get started free</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
